  "_comment": "The one list of Eggify keyboard shortcuts. Keys: 'mod' is Command on macOS and Ctrl on Windows/Linux. 'other' overrides the Windows/Linux keys. browserFallback: in a plain browser tab the key is reserved by a browser (Chrome: ⌘N, ⇧⌘N, ⇧⌘T, ⌘1-9; Firefox also ⇧⌘P private window), so Alt/Option is added (not to keys the user picked). desktopMenu: in the desktop app a native menu item owns the key (cmd/eggify-desktop/shortcut_menu.go) and the page does not handle it. customizable: false keeps the key out of Settings → Keyboard shortcuts (users override the others, utils/shortcuts/overrides.ts). Read by app/utils/shortcuts/catalog.ts and by the desktop app's tests.",
